  "name": "Player Boss Scav",
  "slug": "player-boss-scav",
  "teaser": "Standalone component from APBS. Allows your scav to generate as a boss with a configurable chance.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/NPm1PUyeBnKs0nrJEqhxeQbJeMFMdUL4KnRNAPo5.png",
  "downloads": 6841,
  "favourites_count": 14,
  "description": "<h1>THIS IS NOT COMPATIBLE WITH APBS</h1>\n<h2>This feature is already in APBS.</h2>\n<hr />\n<p>Default chance is 5%</p>\n<p>Player Scav can be any of these bosses:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>bossBoar</li>\n<li>bossBully</li>\n<li>bossGluhar</li>\n<li>bossKilla</li>\n<li>bossKillaAgro</li>\n<li>bossKnight</li>\n<li>bossKojaniy</li>\n<li>bossKolontay</li>\n<li>bossPartisan</li>\n<li>bossSanitar</li>\n<li>bossTagilla</li>\n<li>bossTagillaAgro</li>\n<li>bossZryachiy</li>\n<li>followerBigPipe</li>\n<li>followerBirdEye</li>\n<li>sectantPriest</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Bosses can be removed from the list via the Config.</p>\n<p><em>Please copy and paste, if you don’t then it’s not going to remove it.</em></p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Player Boss Scav</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-playerbossscav</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
